{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15221020","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15221020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1522102001:1":{"text":"マーリン様、覚えていらっしゃいますか？私……カリスです、セミュルの母親です。","source_cn":"梅林女士，您还记得我吗？我、我是卡莉斯，小赛穆的妈妈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9BC21530FAB94BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522102002:0":{"text":"あの時、あなた様は高熱が下がらなかったセミュルを治してくださって……","source_cn":"上次小赛穆高烧不退，是您出手救了他，治好了他的病……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x640F5C02F36D1F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522102003:0":{"text":"お願いです、もう一度……セミュルをお助けください！","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1522102003":{"text":"お願いです、もう一度……セミュルをお助けください！","source_cn":"求求您，再救他一次吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F179988B24E275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522102004:0":{"text":"セミュル……ええ、覚えています。\nあなたの胸に抱かれていた、あの気の毒な男の子ですね。","source_cn":"小赛穆……我记得他。\\n那可怜的、依偎在你怀中的男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C268E5A588589AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522102005:0":{"text":"どのような症状なのですか？","source_cn":"他生了什么病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3454CC4A4CACCDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522102006:0":{"text":"それが、分からなくて……でも、普通の病気じゃないんです！あまりにも奇妙で……<style=\"highlight\">あなた様の魔法じゃないと、ダメなんです</style>！","source_cn":"我、我不知道……但肯定不是普通的病！他病得很诡异，<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE977EF20E592836A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522102007:0":{"text":"病気なら、医者に診せればいいだろう。メイジに頼ってどうする。さっさと帰れ！","source_cn":"孩子生病就该看医生。找这群魔法师有什么用？快回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF09E28100F7DE3F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522102008:0":{"text":"お医者様に診せるお金なんてありません……それに、腕のいいお医者様はみんな、軍に連れて行かれたのですよ！","source_cn":"我哪有钱带小赛穆看医生……而且那些好医生都被你们拉去当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5B9E2406EFAD2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522102009:0":{"text":"マーリン様……お願いです、息子をお助けください……！","source_cn":"梅林女士，求求您，求求您救救我的孩子吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8DB827DA3EEDE6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522102010:0":{"text":"心配はいりません。大切な命を見捨てるわけにはいきませんから。","source_cn":"无需忧虑，我不会对一个珍贵的生命袖手旁观。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3A4504430F5504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522102011:0":{"text":"セミュルは今どこに？案内してくれますか？","source_cn":"小赛穆现在在哪？请带我们过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61C257D7CE0CA0DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522102012:0":{"text":"本当に、ありがとうございます……！","source_cn":"谢谢……谢谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8200F6399E49F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"（黙って初代マーリンを見る）","source_cn":"（沉默地看向初代梅林）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x08E446620BD8DB48","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（黙って初代マーリンを見る）","female":"（黙って初代マーリンを見る）","variant_male_record_index":"77012","variant_female_record_index":"77013","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"（言いかけた言葉を飲み込む）","source_cn":"（尴尬地咽回提问的话）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x124D4FBF167EDC7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（言いかけた言葉を飲み込む）","female":"（言いかけた言葉を飲み込む）","variant_male_record_index":"77014","variant_female_record_index":"77015","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":